  "policy": "Directive (EU) 2024/1275 on the energy performance of buildings (recast)",
  "policyShort": "Energy Performance of Buildings Directive",
  "docType": "Directive",
  "area": "Energy",
  "num": 1,
  "order": 1,
  "text": "1. This Directive promotes the improvement of the energy performance of buildings and the reduction of greenhouse gas emissions from buildings within the Union, with a view to achieving a zero-emission building stock by 2050, taking into account the outdoor climatic conditions, the local conditions, the requirements for indoor environmental quality, and cost-effectiveness.",
