  "docType": "Regulation",
  "area": "Climate",
  "num": 5,
  "order": 1,
  "text": "3. Each Member State shall ensure that the sum of its total emissions and total removals on its territory, in all of the land reporting categories referred to in Article 2(1), results, by applying the accounting rules laid down in this Regulation, in net removals corresponding at least to the target set out in column C of Annex IIa in respect of that Member State for the year 2030, based on the average of its greenhouse gas inventory data for the years 2028, 2029 and 2030.",
