  "climateArgument": "Mitigation — set in the fact-check review, which read the target in the context of the provision it sits in. On the quoted words alone: neither: the target sets no outcome that lowers emissions or raises removals, and none that reduces climate vulnerability, exposure or adaptive capacity — it is kept in the register for review.",
