  "policy": "Directive (EU) 2018/2001 on the promotion of the use of energy from renewable sources (RED II, consolidated as amended by Directive (EU) 2023/2413 – RED III)",
  "policyShort": "Renewable Energy Directive (RED III)",
  "docType": "Directive",
  "area": "Energy",
  "num": 1,
  "order": 1,
  "text": "Member States shall collectively ensure that the share of energy from renewable sources in the Union’s gross final consumption of energy in 2030 is at least 42,5 %. Member States shall collectively endeavour to increase the share of energy from renewable sources in the Union’s gross final consumption of energy in 2030 to 45 %.",
