  "policy": "Directive (EU) 2018/2001 on the promotion of the use of energy from renewable sources (RED II, consolidated as amended by Directive (EU) 2023/2413 – RED III)",
  "policyShort": "Renewable Energy Directive (RED III)",
  "docType": "Directive",
  "area": "Energy",
  "num": 4,
  "order": 2,
  "text": "In order to promote the production and use of renewable energy in the building sector, Member States shall determine an indicative national share of renewable energy produced on-site or nearby as well as renewable energy taken from the grid in final energy consumption in their building sector in 2030 that is consistent with an indicative target of at least a 49 % share of energy from renewable sources in the building sector in the Union’s final energy consumption in buildings in 2030.",
