  "area": "Environment",
  "num": 12,
  "order": 2,
  "text": "·Energy: national building renovation plans, due by 2026, will start being deployed in each Member State to achieve the progressive renovation of existing buildings into highly energy-efficient and decarbonised buildings by 2050, including through approaches and programmes addressing water treatment (Energy Performance of Buildings Directive).",
